<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Geopolitical Intelligence Center</title>

<style>

/* =========================
   DESIGN SYSTEM
========================= */

:root{
--green:#143226;
--green-dark:#0d2119;
--green-light:#204737;
--green-card:#1c3d2f;
--green-soft:#294f3d;
--cream:#F4EEE2;
--cream-dark:#d9d0c2;
--gold:#C4A06D;
--gold-light:#ddbc8a;
--gold-dark:#9f7c4d;
--white:#ffffff;
--signal-low:#8bbf8b;
--signal-watch:#d8c36a;
--signal-high:#d99b5f;
--signal-critical:#d86b63;
}

/* =========================
   RESET
========================= */

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
}

html{
scroll-behavior:smooth;
}

body{
font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;
background:var(--green);
color:var(--cream);
line-height:1.7;
}

/* =========================
   HERO
========================= */

.hero{
padding:110px 30px;
text-align:center;
background:
linear-gradient(
rgba(20,50,38,.82),
rgba(13,33,25,.96)
),
url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521295121783-8a321d551ad2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=80");
background-size:cover;
background-position:center;
border-bottom:3px solid var(--gold);
}

.hero h1{
font-size:clamp(2.7rem,6vw,4.5rem);
margin-bottom:20px;
color:var(--white);
line-height:1.15;
}

.hero p{
max-width:850px;
margin:auto;
font-size:1.15rem;
opacity:.95;
}

.hero-buttons{
margin-top:35px;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
gap:15px;
flex-wrap:wrap;
}

/* =========================
   BUTTONS
========================= */

.btn{
display:inline-block;
padding:14px 28px;
text-decoration:none;
border-radius:10px;
font-weight:700;
transition:.3s;
}

.btn-primary{
background:var(--gold);
color:#111;
}

.btn-primary:hover{
background:var(--gold-light);
transform:translateY(-2px);
}

.btn-secondary{
border:1px solid var(--gold);
color:var(--cream);
}

.btn-secondary:hover{
background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
}

/* =========================
   CONTAINER
========================= */

.container{
max-width:1400px;
margin:auto;
padding:70px 25px;
}

/* =========================
   SECTION TITLES
========================= */

.section-title{
font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3vw,2.2rem);
margin-bottom:15px;
color:var(--gold-light);
border-left:5px solid var(--gold);
padding-left:15px;
}

.section-intro{
max-width:850px;
margin-bottom:35px;
color:var(--cream-dark);
}

/* =========================
   RANGE LEGEND
========================= */

.range-legend{
display:flex;
flex-wrap:wrap;
gap:12px;
margin-bottom:30px;
padding:18px;
background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
border-radius:14px;
}

.legend-item{
display:flex;
align-items:center;
gap:8px;
font-size:.85rem;
}

.legend-dot{
width:11px;
height:11px;
border-radius:50%;
}

.low{
background:var(--signal-low);
}

.watch{
background:var(--signal-watch);
}

.high{
background:var(--signal-high);
}

.critical{
background:var(--signal-critical);
}

/* =========================
   DASHBOARD
========================= */

.dashboard-grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));
gap:25px;
margin-bottom:35px;
}

.intel-card{
background:var(--green-card);
padding:28px;
border-radius:18px;
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
position:relative;
overflow:hidden;
transition:.3s;
}

.intel-card:hover{
transform:translateY(-6px);
border-color:var(--gold);
}

.intel-card::after{
content:"";
position:absolute;
top:0;
left:0;
width:100%;
height:3px;
background:var(--gold);
}

.intel-card h3{
margin-bottom:10px;
color:var(--gold-light);
}

.score-row{
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
align-items:end;
margin-bottom:15px;
}

.score{
font-size:3.3rem;
font-weight:900;
color:var(--gold);
line-height:1;
}

.signal-status{
font-size:.72rem;
font-weight:800;
padding:5px 9px;
border-radius:20px;
text-transform:uppercase;
letter-spacing:1px;
}

.status-watch{
background:rgba(216,195,106,.16);
color:var(--signal-watch);
}

.status-high{
background:rgba(217,155,95,.16);
color:var(--signal-high);
}

.status-critical{
background:rgba(216,107,99,.16);
color:var(--signal-critical);
}

.intel-card p{
font-size:.95rem;
color:var(--cream-dark);
}

/* =========================
   SCORE RANGE
========================= */

.score-range{
margin:18px 0;
}

.range-track{
height:8px;
width:100%;
background:#10271e;
border-radius:20px;
overflow:hidden;
}

.range-fill{
height:100%;
background:linear-gradient(
90deg,
var(--signal-low),
var(--signal-watch),
var(--signal-high),
var(--signal-critical)
);
border-radius:20px;
}

.fill-64{
width:64%;
}

.fill-78{
width:78%;
}

.fill-91{
width:91%;
}

.fill-95{
width:95%;
}

.range-labels{
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
font-size:.7rem;
opacity:.65;
margin-top:5px;
}

/* =========================
   SIGNAL INTERPRETATION
========================= */

.signal-action{
margin-top:15px;
padding-top:15px;
border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
}

.signal-action strong{
display:block;
color:var(--gold-light);
font-size:.82rem;
margin-bottom:5px;
}

.signal-action span{
font-size:.9rem;
color:var(--cream-dark);
}

/* =========================
   DASHBOARD INSTRUCTIONS
========================= */

.dashboard-guide{
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#234737,#163429);
padding:35px;
border-radius:20px;
margin-bottom:80px;
border:1px solid rgba(196,160,109,.25);
}

.dashboard-guide h3{
color:var(--gold-light);
font-size:1.5rem;
margin-bottom:12px;
}

.dashboard-guide > p{
max-width:850px;
margin-bottom:25px;
color:var(--cream-dark);
}

.guide-grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));
gap:18px;
}

.guide-step{
background:rgba(0,0,0,.16);
padding:22px;
border-radius:14px;
}

.guide-number{
width:35px;
height:35px;
display:flex;
align-items:center;
justify-content:center;
border-radius:50%;
background:var(--gold);
color:#111;
font-weight:900;
margin-bottom:12px;
}

.guide-step h4{
color:var(--cream);
margin-bottom:8px;
}

.guide-step p{
font-size:.9rem;
color:var(--cream-dark);
}

/* =========================
   STRATEGIC RESPONSE MATRIX
========================= */

.response-grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));
gap:22px;
margin-bottom:80px;
}

.response-card{
background:var(--green-card);
padding:25px;
border-radius:18px;
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
}

.response-card h3{
color:var(--gold-light);
margin-bottom:12px;
}

.response-card p{
color:var(--cream-dark);
margin-bottom:15px;
}

.response-card ul{
padding-left:18px;
color:var(--cream-dark);
}

.response-card li{
margin-bottom:8px;
}

/* =========================
   GRID
========================= */

.grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));
gap:25px;
margin-bottom:80px;
}

/* =========================
   CARDS
========================= */

.card{
background:var(--green-card);
padding:25px;
border-radius:18px;
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
transition:.35s;
}

.card:hover{
transform:translateY(-8px);
border-color:var(--gold);
}

.card h3{
margin-bottom:15px;
color:var(--gold-light);
}

.card p{
opacity:.9;
}

/* =========================
   SIMULATION
========================= */

.simulation-grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));
gap:25px;
margin-bottom:80px;
}

.sim-card{
background:var(--green-card);
padding:30px;
border-radius:18px;
text-align:center;
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
}

.sim-card h3{
margin-bottom:15px;
color:var(--gold-light);
}

/* =========================
   THINKING QUESTIONS
========================= */

.questions{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));
gap:25px;
margin-bottom:80px;
}

.question-box{
background:linear-gradient(
135deg,
#234737,
#163429
);
padding:30px;
border-radius:18px;
border-left:4px solid var(--gold);
transition:.3s;
}

.question-box:hover{
transform:translateY(-4px);
}

.question-box p{
font-size:1.05rem;
}

/* =========================
   FEED
========================= */

.feed{
display:grid;
gap:18px;
margin-bottom:80px;
}

.feed-item{
background:var(--green-card);
padding:20px;
border-radius:12px;
border-left:4px solid var(--gold);
}

/* =========================
   TIMELINE
========================= */

.timeline{
display:grid;
gap:25px;
margin-bottom:80px;
}

.timeline-item{
background:var(--green-card);
padding:25px;
border-radius:16px;
position:relative;
padding-left:40px;
}

.timeline-item::before{
content:"";
position:absolute;
left:14px;
top:30px;
width:10px;
height:10px;
background:var(--gold);
border-radius:50%;
}

/* =========================
   PERSONAL STRATEGY
========================= */

.strategy-board{
background:#10271e;
padding:40px;
border-radius:24px;
margin-bottom:80px;
border:1px solid rgba(196,160,109,.25);
}

.strategy-board h2{
color:var(--gold-light);
margin-bottom:12px;
font-size:2rem;
}

.strategy-board > p{
max-width:850px;
color:var(--cream-dark);
margin-bottom:30px;
}

.strategy-grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr));
gap:18px;
}

.strategy-item{
background:var(--green-card);
padding:22px;
border-radius:16px;
}

.strategy-item span{
display:block;
font-size:.75rem;
letter-spacing:1.5px;
font-weight:800;
color:var(--gold);
margin-bottom:8px;
}

.strategy-item h3{
margin-bottom:10px;
color:var(--cream);
font-size:1.05rem;
}

.strategy-item p{
font-size:.9rem;
color:var(--cream-dark);
}

/* =========================
   BRIDGE
========================= */

.bridge{
text-align:center;
background:linear-gradient(
135deg,
#234737,
#173126
);
padding:70px 30px;
border-radius:25px;
margin-bottom:50px;
}

.bridge h2{
font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.5rem);
margin-bottom:20px;
color:var(--gold-light);
}

.bridge p{
max-width:800px;
margin:auto;
margin-bottom:30px;
}

/* =========================
   FOOTER
========================= */

footer{
padding:40px;
text-align:center;
border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
opacity:.8;
}

/* =========================
   MOBILE
========================= */

@media(max-width:768px){

.hero{
padding:80px 20px;
}

.container{
padding:50px 18px;
}

.dashboard-guide,
.strategy-board{
padding:25px;
}

.score{
font-size:2.8rem;
}

.section-title{
font-size:1.5rem;
}

}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- HERO -->

<section class="hero">

<h1>Geopolitical Intelligence Center</h1>

<p>
Understand the large systems shaping opportunity, migration,
technology competition, resource control, labor markets,
infrastructure, and long-term economic power.
</p>

<div class="hero-buttons">

<a href="#strategy" class="btn btn-primary">
Build Personal Strategy
</a>

<a href="#dashboard" class="btn btn-secondary">
Read Strategic Signals
</a>

</div>

</section>

<div class="container">

<!-- DASHBOARD -->

<section id="dashboard">

<h2 class="section-title">Global Strategic Dashboard</h2>

<p class="section-intro">
These scores are not predictions and should not be treated as instructions
by themselves. The purpose of the dashboard is to help users identify
important signals, investigate what may be changing, and ask how those
changes could affect their skills, career, business, location, or strategy.
</p>

<div class="range-legend">
<div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot low"></span>0–39 Monitor</div>
<div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot watch"></span>40–69 Watch</div>
<div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot high"></span>70–89 High Signal</div>
<div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot critical"></span>90–100 Major Strategic Signal</div>
</div>

<div class="dashboard-grid">

<div class="intel-card">

<h3>Population Shift Index</h3>

<div class="score-row">
<div class="score">78</div>
<span class="signal-status status-high">High Signal</span>
</div>

<div class="score-range">
<div class="range-track">
<div class="range-fill fill-78"></div>
</div>
<div class="range-labels">
<span>0</span>
<span>25</span>
<span>50</span>
<span>75</span>
<span>100</span>
</div>
</div>

<p>Population shifts may affect labor availability, housing, migration, and demand for services.</p>

<div class="signal-action">
<strong>STRATEGIC QUESTION</strong>
<span>Which industries could gain or lose from changing population structures?</span>
</div>

</div>

<div class="intel-card">

<h3>Water Security</h3>

<div class="score-row">
<div class="score">64</div>
<span class="signal-status status-watch">Watch</span>
</div>

<div class="score-range">
<div class="range-track">
<div class="range-fill fill-64"></div>
</div>
<div class="range-labels">
<span>0</span>
<span>25</span>
<span>50</span>
<span>75</span>
<span>100</span>
</div>
</div>

<p>Water infrastructure and efficient resource management may become increasingly important.</p>

<div class="signal-action">
<strong>STRATEGIC QUESTION</strong>
<span>What businesses, technologies, and careers solve resource-efficiency problems?</span>
</div>

</div>

<div class="intel-card">

<h3>Energy Transition</h3>

<div class="score-row">
<div class="score">91</div>
<span class="signal-status status-critical">Major Signal</span>
</div>

<div class="score-range">
<div class="range-track">
<div class="range-fill fill-91"></div>
</div>
<div class="range-labels">
<span>0</span>
<span>25</span>
<span>50</span>
<span>75</span>
<span>100</span>
</div>
</div>

<p>Energy systems may influence infrastructure investment, manufacturing, transportation, and new industries.</p>

<div class="signal-action">
<strong>STRATEGIC QUESTION</strong>
<span>Which skills support the industries building, maintaining, or improving future energy systems?</span>
</div>

</div>

<div class="intel-card">

<h3>AI Competition</h3>

<div class="score-row">
<div class="score">95</div>
<span class="signal-status status-critical">Major Signal</span>
</div>

<div class="score-range">
<div class="range-track">
<div class="range-fill fill-95"></div>
</div>
<div class="range-labels">
<span>0</span>
<span>25</span>
<span>50</span>
<span>75</span>
<span>100</span>
</div>
</div>

<p>AI development may change productivity, job tasks, business models, and demand for technical capability.</p>

<div class="signal-action">
<strong>STRATEGIC QUESTION</strong>
<span>Which parts of my current work could be improved, redesigned, or complemented by AI?</span>
</div>

</div>

</div>

<!-- HOW TO USE -->

<div class="dashboard-guide">

<h3>What Should You Do With This Information?</h3>

<p>
A dashboard should not simply make people aware of trends. The purpose is
to move from signal to investigation and from investigation to a possible
strategic response.
</p>

<div class="guide-grid">

<div class="guide-step">
<div class="guide-number">1</div>
<h4>Notice the Signal</h4>
<p>
Identify trends that appear important enough to investigate rather than
reacting to every headline.
</p>
</div>

<div class="guide-step">
<div class="guide-number">2</div>
<h4>Ask Who Is Affected</h4>
<p>
Consider which industries, regions, careers, businesses, and communities
could experience change.
</p>
</div>

<div class="guide-step">
<div class="guide-number">3</div>
<h4>Find the Mechanism</h4>
<p>
Ask how the trend could actually create consequences. Look for causes,
constraints, incentives, and dependencies.
</p>
</div>

<div class="guide-step">
<div class="guide-number">4</div>
<h4>Choose a Response</h4>
<p>
Learn a skill, research an industry, build a project, monitor the trend,
or prepare for possible changes.
</p>
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<!-- RESPONSE MATRIX -->

<h2 class="section-title">Signal → Investigation → Response</h2>

<p class="section-intro">
The purpose of strategic intelligence is not to predict the future perfectly.
It is to improve the quality of preparation.
</p>

<div class="response-grid">

<div class="response-card">
<h3>AI Signal</h3>
<p>Rapid technological development may change how work is performed.</p>
<ul>
<li>Map tasks likely to change.</li>
<li>Learn complementary skills.</li>
<li>Experiment with AI tools.</li>
<li>Build evidence of practical capability.</li>
</ul>
</div>

<div class="response-card">
<h3>Population Signal</h3>
<p>Demographic changes may reshape demand and labor availability.</p>
<ul>
<li>Research growing populations.</li>
<li>Study industries with changing demand.</li>
<li>Track housing and labor trends.</li>
<li>Look for underserved needs.</li>
</ul>
</div>

<div class="response-card">
<h3>Resource Signal</h3>
<p>Scarcity or infrastructure pressure can create both risks and opportunities.</p>
<ul>
<li>Identify important dependencies.</li>
<li>Study efficiency technologies.</li>
<li>Monitor infrastructure investment.</li>
<li>Research businesses solving the constraint.</li>
</ul>
</div>

<div class="response-card">
<h3>Economic Signal</h3>
<p>Economic changes can alter costs, consumer behavior, and employment.</p>
<ul>
<li>Build adaptable skills.</li>
<li>Reduce unnecessary dependencies.</li>
<li>Strengthen multiple options.</li>
<li>Monitor changes before making major decisions.</li>
</ul>
</div>

</div>

<!-- FIVE FORCES -->

<h2 class="section-title">Five Forces Reshaping Opportunity</h2>

<div class="grid">

<div class="card">
<h3>Demographic Reality</h3>
<p>
Population structure can influence labor markets, taxation,
housing demand, healthcare needs, and economic growth.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Water & Agriculture</h3>
<p>
Food production and communities depend on reliable resource systems.
Efficiency and infrastructure may create important opportunities.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Infrastructure Power</h3>
<p>
Ports, rail systems, roads, energy grids, and digital connectivity
can shape long-term economic competitiveness.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Technology Sovereignty</h3>
<p>
AI, semiconductors, automation, and advanced manufacturing
may increasingly influence national and economic capabilities.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Talent Competition</h3>
<p>
Regions and organizations compete for skilled workers, entrepreneurs,
engineers, scientists, and other forms of human capability.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Supply Chain Control</h3>
<p>
Shipping routes, logistics, energy networks, and critical resources
can create strategic dependencies and leverage.
</p>
</div>

</div>

<!-- SIMULATOR -->

<h2 class="section-title">Opportunity Migration Simulator</h2>

<div class="simulation-grid">

<div class="sim-card">
<h3>High Cost Economy</h3>
<p>
Higher wages may exist alongside greater competition and higher living costs.
Ask whether income growth exceeds the cost of participation.
</p>
</div>

<div class="sim-card">
<h3>Growth Economy</h3>
<p>
Rapid development may create opportunities for people who identify
new needs, industries, and infrastructure gaps.
</p>
</div>

<div class="sim-card">
<h3>Remote Economy</h3>
<p>
Global work can potentially separate income location from living location,
creating new strategic choices around cost and opportunity.
</p>
</div>

</div>

<!-- QUESTIONS -->

<h2 class="section-title">Think Like a Strategist</h2>

<div class="questions">

<div class="question-box">
<p>If energy costs doubled tomorrow, which industries would benefit and which would face greater pressure?</p>
</div>

<div class="question-box">
<p>How could declining birth rates change housing demand over the next 20 years?</p>
</div>

<div class="question-box">
<p>Which skills could become more valuable as routine tasks become increasingly automated?</p>
</div>

<div class="question-box">
<p>What happens to an economy when it struggles to attract or retain skilled workers?</p>
</div>

<div class="question-box">
<p>Which regions could benefit from increased investment in climate adaptation?</p>
</div>

<div class="question-box">
<p>What infrastructure creates the greatest long-term leverage for businesses and communities?</p>
</div>

</div>

<!-- FEED -->

<h2 class="section-title">Strategic Signals Feed</h2>

<div class="feed">

<div class="feed-item">
Population shifts may change workforce availability and demand for essential services.
</div>

<div class="feed-item">
AI investment may concentrate around major innovation hubs and technical infrastructure.
</div>

<div class="feed-item">
Automation may continue changing which tasks are performed by people and machines.
</div>

<div class="feed-item">
Trade routes and supply chains can change when infrastructure, costs, and strategic relationships change.
</div>

<div class="feed-item">
Water infrastructure may become increasingly important where resource pressure grows.
</div>

<div class="feed-item">
Energy resilience can influence long-term infrastructure and economic planning.
</div>

</div>

<!-- HISTORY -->

<h2 class="section-title">Historical Pattern Library</h2>

<div class="timeline">

<div class="timeline-item">
<h3>Industrial Revolution</h3>
<p>
Technology transformed productivity, changed labor systems, and created entirely new industries.
</p>
</div>

<div class="timeline-item">
<h3>Information Age</h3>
<p>
Computing and networks made information increasingly valuable and reshaped communication and business.
</p>
</div>

<div class="timeline-item">
